{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4c5d11c1-d8f0-8cd8-9400-51037a44c328",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T10:52:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Edson Andrade",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Kevin. Edson Andrade. I'm calling about water in my cellar after that coastal storm Friday and Saturday. Three days ago now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where's the house, Edson?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "93 Kay Street, up Historic Hill. Right near, uh, where the old market was. Well, not the market, the laundromat. Anyway, Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 93 Kay. And how much water are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches. Seeped right in along the back wall. And that's the thing, I've been in this house years and it has never once done that. Never. Not in any storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, okay. So first time. Did it come up through a floor drain or the walls?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Walls and the floor, mostly. And out front there's a manhole cover that looks off to me. Sitting maybe an inch high, or crooked, one of those. I never noticed it before the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, manhole cover, about an inch off, out front of 93 Kay. Writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So what I want to know is when did anybody last come by and look at the drains on my street? Because nobody I've seen. Not this year, not last year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see the cleaning schedule from here, honestly. I'll put in a request for a crew to inspect the drain and the cover and have somebody get back to you with the last service date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'm saying, I shouldn't have to call to find that out. Look, I play euchre every Friday with the same four people, and I was down there bailing instead of dealing cards. It's not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a rough way to spend a Friday. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:06-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0157, Edson Andrade, 93 Kay Street. You'll get a call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope so. Thanks, Kevin."
    }
  ],
